/target
/output
/dist

# Resource corpora (the EVO and Xseed mods plus the original GungHo baseline) are
# local-only build inputs. They are NOT redistributed via git: obtain them yourself
# per the README "Compatibility" section and extract them here to build. Only the
# folder skeleton (.gitkeep) is tracked; everything else under resources/ is ignored
# (the .dat scripts, .tbl tables, regenerable .ing decompiles, and .pac archives).
resources/**
!resources/**/
!resources/**/.gitkeep
